NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000454 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000455 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000456 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000457 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000458 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000459 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000460 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000461 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000462 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000463 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000464 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000465 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000466 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000467 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000468 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000469 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000470 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000471 ""
